# Round 16: DCH/ICH post-shift wide-orphan repair uses the active BCE blank.

case r16_dch_post_shift_orphan_uses_blue_bce_blank
size 5 2 100
emit 5
print A界XYF
style blue-bg
cup 1 1
dch 2
expect 0 1 <space>XY<space><space>|F
end

